{"id":"47e441115dc87ddf","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-algebraizable-logic.md","title":"Algebraizable Logic","display":"Algebraizable Logic","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-algebraizable-logic","aliases":["93-cor-algebraizable-logic"],"display":"Algebraizable Logic","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-algebraizable]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-extension]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]","[[93-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-algebraizable-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-algebraizable-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Algebraizable Logic"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a55351eb48f8bd69\" href=\"?note=a55351eb48f8bd69\" title=\"93-df-algebraizable\">93-df-algebraizable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f\" href=\"?note=a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f\" title=\"93-df-extension\">93-df-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-algebraizable-logic---Algebraizable-Logic\">cor-algebraizable-logic - Algebraizable Logic</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a logic candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is fixed, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> is the sourced formula carrier of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\)</span>, and the setwise extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\tau[-]\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\tau[-]\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a55351eb48f8bd69\" href=\"?note=a55351eb48f8bd69\" title=\"93-df-algebraizable\">93-df-algebraizable</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\tau\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Gamma]\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\varphi)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\tau\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Gamma]\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\varphi)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the consequence-preservation component actually guaranteed by algebraizability; no undefined “transfer” or lattice-isomorphism predicate is introduced.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-algebraizable-logic---Algebraizable-Logic","text":"cor-algebraizable-logic - Algebraizable Logic","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebraizable","status":"resolved","id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d